OL,3,GNEWSAHome Office investigating after
OL,4,ABBC catches lawyer offering to make
OL,5,Afines go away
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Home Office has launched an
OL,8,Finvestigation after a solicitor was
OL,9,Fsecretly filmed by the BBC explaining
OL,10,Fhow he could make a #45,000
OL,11,Fillegal-working fine go away.
OL,13,FMohammad Alias Yousaf - also known as
OL,14,FAlias - made the claim to an undercover
OL,15,Freporter, who was posing as a mini-mart
OL,16,Fowner facing a fine for employing an
OL,17,Fillegal worker.
OL,19,FThe Solicitors Regulation Authority has
OL,20,Fsaid it will also examine the BBC's
OL,21,Ffindings to see whether there has been
OL,22,Fmisconduct by solicitors or law firms.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
