OL,3,GNEWSAHome Office investigating after
OL,4,ABBC catches lawyer offering to make
OL,5,Afines go away
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bradford-based solicitor told his
OL,8,Fpotential client he could avoid paying
OL,9,Fthe fine if he was able to find someone
OL,10,Foverseas prepared to declare themselves
OL,11,Fthe owner of the mini-mart.
